Q1. Store and Display Personal Information
Question:
Write a program to store a person's name, age, height, and city in variables and display all the information.

Sample Input:
Name: Rahul
Age: 22
Height: 5.8
City: Meerut


Expected Output:
Name: Rahul
Age: 22
Height: 5.8
City: Meerut


Python Code:
name = "Rahul"age = 22height = 5.8city = "Meerut"print("Name:", name)print("Age:", age)print("Height:", height)print("City:", city)



C Code:
#include <stdio.h>

int main() {
    char name[] = "Rahul";
    int age = 22;
    float height = 5.8;
    char city[] = "Meerut";

    printf("Name: %s\n", name);
    printf("Age: %d\n", age);
    printf("Height: %.1f\n", height);
    printf("City: %s\n", city);

    return 0;
}


Java Code:
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String name = "Rahul";
        int age = 22;
        float height = 5.8f;
        String city = "Meerut";

        System.out.println("Name: " + name);
        System.out.println("Age: " + age);
        System.out.println("Height: " + height);
        System.out.println("City: " + city);
    }
}



